u 11:25</a> + 7 times, shekel <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:13\" href=\"/Numbers.7.13\">7:13</a> + 11 times, other n. 5 times"}], "num": "a."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "before n.pl. kings <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:7\" href=\"/Judges.1.7\">Ju 1:7</a>, sons <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:30\" href=\"/Judges.8.30\">8:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:24\" href=\"/Judges.9.24\">9:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.1\">2 K 10:1</a>, brothers <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:56\" href=\"/Judges.9.56\">Ju 9:56</a>, asses <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:14\" href=\"/Judges.12.14\">12:14</a>, palms <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:27\" href=\"/Exodus.15.27\">Ex 15:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:9\" href=\"/Numbers.33.9\">Nu 33:9</a>, males <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:7\" href=\"/Ezra.8.7\">Ezr 8:7</a>,<a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:14\" href=\"/Ezra.8.14\">14</a>."}], "num": "b."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "after n. coll. <span dir=\"rtl\">(בָּקָר)</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:32\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.32\">2 Ch 29:32</a>, n.pl. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:24\" href=\"/Daniel.9.24\">Dn 9:24</a>."}], "num": "c."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "pred. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:27\" href=\"/Genesis.46.27\">Gn 46:27</a>."}], "num": "d."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "n. om. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:1\" href=\"/Exodus.24.1\">Ex 24:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:9\" href=\"/Exodus.24.9\">9</a> (man), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:85\" href=\"/Numbers.7.85\">Nu 7:85</a> (shekel), cf. <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:4\" href=\"/Judges.9.4\">Ju 9:4</a>"}], "num": "e."}], "num": "1."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ אֶלֶף</span> = 70,000 <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.15\">2 S 24:15</a> + 6 times."}], "num": "2."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "+ other num.:"}, {"senses": [{"definition": "+ unit + n. s. <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:14\" href=\"/Judges.8.14\">Ju 8:14</a>; n. om. 70 + 7 (times) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:24\" href=\"/Genesis.4.24\">Gn 4:24</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:40\" href=\"/Ezra.2.40\">Ezr 2:40</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:42\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.42\">Ne 7:43</a>, so 2 + 70 <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:38\" href=\"/Numbers.31.38\">Nu 31:38</a>; n.pl. + 70 + 7 <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:35\" href=\"/Ezra.8.35\">Ezr 8:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:5\" href=\"/Ezra.8.5\">5</a> years + 70 year <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:4\" href=\"/Genesis.12.4\">Gn 12:4</a>."}], "num": "a."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "5 + 70 × 1000 (man) <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:16\" href=\"/Esther.9.16\">Est 9:16</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:4\" href=\"/Numbers.2.4\">Nu 2:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:43\" href=\"/Numbers.3.43\">3:43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:32\" href=\"/Numbers.26.32\">26:32</a>; 2 + 70 × 1000 <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:33\" href=\"/Numbers.31.33\">31:33</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בָּקָר</span> precedes); 70 man, 50 × 1000 man <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.19\">1 S 6:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.7\">7</a> + 70 year + 7 × 100 year <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:31\" href=\"/Genesis.5.31\">Gn 5:31</a>; n. om. 3 + 70 + 200 <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:46\" href=\"/Numbers.3.46\">Nu 3:46</a>."}], "num": "b."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "70 foll. hundreds: 70 year + 5 years <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:7\" href=\"/Genesis.25.7\">Gn 25:7</a>, and (n. om.) 70 + 2 <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:3\" href=\"/Ezra.2.3\">Ezr 2:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:4\" href=\"/Ezra.2.4\">4</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.8\">Ne 7:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.19\">Ne 11:19</a>; + 3 <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:36\" href=\"/Ezra.2.36\">Ezr 2:36</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:38\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.38\">Ne 7:39</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.5\">5</a> + 70 <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:5\" href=\"/Ezra.2.5\">Ezr 2:5</a>."}], "num": "c."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "1000 + 7 × 100 + 5 + 70 shekel <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:25\" href=\"/Exodus.38.25\">Ex 38:25</a> and (n. om.) v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:28\" href=\"/Exodus.38.28\">28</a>."}], "num": "d."}], "num": "3."}]}, "rid": "BDB09914", "strong_numbers": ["7657"], "next_hw": "שְׁבִיעִי", "prev_hw": "שִׁבְעָה", "occurrences": "91", "quotes": [], "GK": ["8684"], "TWOT": ["2318a", "2318b"], "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "BDB Dictionary", "language": "heb.biblical", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "BDB Dictionary", "attribution": "F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs", "index_title": "BDB", "version_title": "A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "שְׁבִיעִי", "parent_lexicon": "BDB Dictionary", "content": {"senses": [{"definition": "<strong>m.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבִיעִית</span> <strong>f.</strong><sub>97</sub> <strong>adj. num. ord. seventh</strong>;—<strong>m.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבִיעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:2\" href=\"/Genesis.2.2\">Gn 2:2</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבִעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:15\" href=\"/Exodus.12.15\">Ex 12:15</a> +; <strong>f.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבִיעִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:16\" href=\"/Joshua.6.16\">Jos 6:16</a> +, -<span dir=\"rtl\">עִת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:11\" href=\"/Exodus.23.11\">Ex 23:11</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבִעִת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:2\" href=\"/Exodus.21.2\">21:2</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">עִית</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:44\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.44\">1 K 18:44</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.1\">2 Ch 23:1</a>;—<em>seventh</em>, especially P; always c. art.:"}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<strong> m.</strong> 7th day <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:3\" href=\"/Genesis.2.3\">Gn 2:3</a> + 47 times; month <span dir=\"rtl\">(חֹדֶשׁ)</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:4\" href=\"/Genesis.8.4\">8:4</a> + 23 times + (n. om.) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.25\">Ez 45:25</a> + 3 times; lot <span dir=\"rtl\">(הַגּוֹרָל)</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:40\" href=\"/Joshua.19.40\">Jos 19:40</a> + (n. om.) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.10\">1 Ch 24:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.14\">25:14</a>; n. om. also <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.15\">1 Ch 2:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.3\">26:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.5\">5</a> (son), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.11\">12:11</a> (man), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.10\">27:10</a> (captain)."}], "num": "1."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<strong> f.</strong> 7th year, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.4\">2 K 11:4</a> + 7 times + (n. om.) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:2\" href=\"/Exodus.21.2\">Ex 21:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:11\" href=\"/Exodus.23.11\">23:11</a>, also <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנַת הַשְּׁבִיעִית</span> (Ges<sup>§ 134 p</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:8\" href=\"/Ezra.7.8\">Ezr 7:8</a>; sabbath <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.16\">Lv 23:16</a>; time <span dir=\"rtl\">(פַּעַם)</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:16\" href=\"/Joshua.6.16\">Jos 6:16</a> + (n. om.) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:44\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.44\">1 K 18:44</a>."}], "num": "2."}]}, "rid": "BDB09915", "strong_numbers": ["7637", "7657"], "next_hw": "שִׁבְעָ֫נָה", "prev_hw": "שִׁבְעִים", "quotes": [], "GK": ["8668", "8684"], "TWOT": ["2318b"], "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "BDB Dictionary", "language": "heb.biblical", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "BDB Dictionary", "attribution": "F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs", "index_title": "BDB", "version_title": "A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "שִׁבְעִים", "parent_lexicon": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "content": {"definition": ["<p><sup class=\"footnote-marker\">1</sup><i class=\"footnote\">[אין כאן כמובן מ\"ר סתם מן שבע (שכן שבע עצמו הוא רבוי), ושים לב להבדל במבנה המלה שלשים, ארבעים, שבעים וכו' המורות על עשר פעמים שלוש, ארבע, שבע, למלת עֶשְׂרִים שהיא כאלו מ\"ר או מ\"ז מן עשר(ה), ולא כמבנה המלים zwanzig, twenty, בלע\"ז, כצורה מרחבת ממספר השנים.]</i>, שם מספר זו\"נ, —  שבע פעמים עשר, 70; siebzig; soixante-dix; seventy: כי שבעתים יקם קין ולמך שִׁבְעִים ושבעה <span class=\"by-source\">(בראש' ד כד)</span>. ויהי כל ימי למך שבע וְשִׁבְעִים שנה ושבע מאות שנה <span class=\"by-source\">(שם ה לא)</span>. ויהי כל נפש יצאי ירך יעקב שִׁבְעִים נפש <span class=\"by-source\">(שמות א ה)</span>.  בְּשִׁבְעִים נפש ירדו אבתיך מצרימה <span class=\"by-source\">(דבר' י כב)</span>.  ועי' <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Ben_Yehuda_Dictionary,_שֶׁבַע_I.1\" data-ref=\"Ben Yehuda Dictionary, שֶׁבַע I 1\">שֶׁבַע</a>. —  ובתו\"מ:  הרי אני כבן <strong>שבעים </strong>שנה <span class=\"by-source\">(ר' אלעזר בן עזריה, ברכ' א ה)</span>.  אין דנים לא את השבט ולא את נביא השקר וכו' אלא בבית דין של <strong>שבעים </strong>ואחד <span class=\"by-source\">(סנה' א ה)</span>. והיה (מרדכי) יודע <strong>בשבעים </strong>לשון <span class=\"by-source\">(מגי' יג:)</span>.  ועי' <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Ben_Yehuda_Dictionary,_לָשׁוֹן.1\" data-ref=\"Ben Yehuda Dictionary, לָשׁוֹן 1\">לָשׁוֹן</a>. —  °ונוהג השם שִׁבְעִים ככנוי לתרגום היוני של המקרא המיוחס לשבעים הזקנים Septuaginta.</p>"]}, "rid": "BY-19600", "prev_hw": "שֶׁבַע II", "next_hw": "שִׁבְעָנָה", "page_num": 6858, "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "language": "heb", "to_language": "heb", "text_categories": [], "index_title": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "version_title": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "version_lang": "he", "should_autocomplete": true}}]